{"about_the_game":"PLEASE NOTE: Text style in the screenshots is subject to change, as the build is still under construction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/ffc433d0d6a6015fe0393acc06b4a708.avif?t=1599779669\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><br>LAMUNATION -International- is a comedy visual novel featuring all that is good and holy in this world: Carbonated drinks. Exotic sportscars. Lovely ladies. A retro '80s-style soundtrack infused with modern EDM bops. A rubber duckie. And over 9000* memes.<br><br>This is no tearjerker. (Though you might end up jerkin' something else.) It's a thrilling social media success story that puts the 'app' in 'happiness'! (And maybe the 'piness' too...)<br><br>*Estimated<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/b06ebffc6d8a9917e46bed577bfd0c3d.avif?t=1599779669\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><br>Now, this is a story all about how<br>Luna's life got flipped-turned upside down<br>And I'd like to take a minute<br>So listen to the story<br>I'll tell you how he helped his friends save an old factory<br><br>In coastal Saint Aria, born and raised<br>With a rubber duckie's how he spends most of his days<br>Chillin' out, maxin', gettin' all snoozy<br>And skipping out of class so he can stay in his jacuzzi<br>When a couple of girls who were heading to class<br>Skydived to his yard and dragged his lazy ass<br>Shoved him into car-- At least it wasn't a van--<br>And said 'It's time to go to the Academy of Hope Island'<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/777eb598c8d0ab5f24569c728f8cbaba.avif?t=1599779669\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/ade4743f8e7605385215e984481bcd3e.avif?t=1599779669\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><strong>Lamune Aoumi</strong> : The cool, kind childhood friend.<br><br>As an only child, she dreams of inheriting the Aoumi Lamune Factory from her parents.<br>She loves Luna just as much as she loves lamune.<br>What's lamune, you ask? It's the traditional soft drink of Japan, served in a marble-stopped bottle.<br>Hmm? No, I'm pretty sure that's how it's spelled.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/6abc53f68455c357adeffa86d546000f.avif?t=1599779669\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><strong>Corona Akahoshi</strong> : The finest sister ever.<br><br>Luna's younger twin sister. Younger by like five minutes, but the point still stands.<br>She's cunning, clever, and caring.<br>And she loves Luna.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/c1f8079525488ee5ab259cfa64d79e58.avif?t=1599779669\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><strong>Iris &quot;CH&quot; Prateado</strong> : Too cute. Too crazy.<br><br>A lovely, lively little lady.<br>She loves everyone....<br>about as much as she loves supersonic attack helicopters.<br>The &quot;CH&quot; stands for &quot;The Crystal Heart&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/03fac8b9ff242a1259ecad7ca0bdee5a.avif?t=1599779669\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><strong>Rayla &quot;MC&quot; Prateado</strong> : Domo arigato Ms. Perfect.<br><br>The sole chef of the Cherry Crown Diner.<br>Everything she does, she does to perfection.<br>She's gentle, and reliable, and she loves everyone.<br>The &quot;MC&quot; stands for &quot;The Million Carat&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/7136fc64f0aac5820fd72321a44fce5e.avif?t=1599779669\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><strong>Luna Akahoshi</strong> : Good guy in the jacuzzi.<br><br>He's always chilling in the jacuzzi at home with his best friend, a rubber duckie.<br>The goodest guy you'll ever meet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/463b44adaeb3b1d2269c0b6a5a1542d8.avif?t=1599779669\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><strong>Rubber Duckie</strong> : The real protagonist of our story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/9f355616e6670f1cd3e2ac4b25ab76a5.avif?t=1599779669\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><strong>Solaris</strong> : Say Hi.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1025140/extras/e79defa6c3a36ba65ba20de46cc6f1cf.avif?t=1599779669\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br><br>Let's see what fabulous features we have in store for you:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All-ages version plus a free patch<br></li><li>Full Japanese voice acting<br></li><li>Memes<br></li><li>Japanese, Chinese and English text<br></li><li>More memes<br></li><li>An awesome 80\u2019s-inspired soundtrack<br></li><li>A rubber duckie<br></li><li>30 hours of playtime<br></li><li>Did we mention memes???</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"63ac9ee37cd56dcdb390b21efd75629dc3058bb6.jpg","localized_name":"Lamunation Initiation","name":"Lamunation Initiation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1025140/63ac9ee37cd56dcdb390b21efd75629dc3058bb6.jpg"},{"icon":"044ba8595e8647749d9666904786921f1ee96546.jpg","localized_name":"Konnichi Wassup","name":"Konnichi Wassup","path":"htt